  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>RM_Ommolyn</defName>
    <label>ommolyn</label>
    <description>Above the mud, a single modest cream flower on a short stalk and a few limp surface leaves. Below, a buried maze of forked hollow tubes lined with inward-pointing hairs that admit and never release. Nothing on the surface suggests it — but the mud within a tile or two is conspicuously free of scuttlers, and that absence is the tell. Its tube-fibre is the only cordage that survives the brine.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Plant/RM_Ommolyn/RM_Ommolyn_a</texPath>
